    "## Part C – Time-Series Analysis\n",
    "If the cleaned dataset contains a date column, the notebook converts it to a time series, resamples it, shows trend/seasonality/residuals when possible, and creates a simple moving-average forecast. If no date column exists, this section is skipped and the notebook continues to clustering."
   ]
